WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
This is Fusion Studio.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.900
Start with your own assets.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.300
Bring your DAZ library.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.700
Shape it in Fusion.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.100
Different sources.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.500
One editable workspace.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.900
Keep native rendering.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.300
Keep control of the geometry.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.700
Here is how it works.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.900
Review conversion limits first.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:28.900
Import an editable working copy.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.500
Or preserve the native scene.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.100
Render with its original camera and shaders.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:39.700
Import a real MuscleShirt .duf.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.300
Mesh, textures and rig come through.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.300
Choose a compatible material preset.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:48.100
Apply supported color properties.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:50.100
Undo. Restore material state.

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.900
Redo. Recover the applied preset.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.100
Legacy shader parity remains limited.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:01:02.100
A real sculpt stroke changes the mesh.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.100
Undo restores the exact geometry.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.900
Redo recovers the sculpt.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.300
Your changes remain editable.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:11.500
Save. Reopen the same geometry.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.700
Export a validated GLB working copy.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.100
Connect your local Ollama model.

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.500
Ask Phi-3 a question.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.500
A real response from your model.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:26.500
Conversational chat. Scene edits stay separate.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.300
An authenticated client inspects the scene.

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.700
Add a primitive through MCP.

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.100
Set its transform.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.500
Undo through the same history.

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:39.700
Redo. Recover the change.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:44.500
Import. Shape. Recover.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.300
Your assets can stay with you.

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:54.100
And the original stays intact.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:57.100
Fusion Studio 0.19.0-rc.1.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:00.000
Music: Secret — ESPRIT 空想.
